Description Commensurate twisted-bilayer graphene band structure
Prefix generate

TypeOfSystem TwistedBilayerBasedOnMoireCell
TypeOfBL Koshino

MoireCellParameters 3 2 2 3
SuperCell 1
twoLayers .true.
twoLayersZ1 18.33
twoLayersZ2 21.67
InterlayerDistance 3.34
CellHeight 40.0

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.Bands .true.

Bands.NumPoints 12
&begin Bands.Path 4
2/3  1/3  0.0  # K
0.0  0.0  0.0  # Gamma
0.5  0.0  0.0  # M
2/3  1/3  0.0  # K'
&end Bands.Path

Neigh.fastNNnotsquare .true.
Neigh.LayerNeighbors 100
Neigh.LayerDistFactor 6.2

# Intralayer model: nearest-neighbor hopping only (one neighbor shell).
# TB.NeighLevels 5 selects the full F2G2 intralayer model instead, which gives
# different bands and has no reference data here.
TB.NeighLevels 1

WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
